    "paused": "Master volume, battle mute, tab visibility and disconnect stop sources. Pauses preserve the timeline and resume intro/loop at the correct offset. Finish resets it for the next challenge.",
    "performance": "Only preloaded on this house; two buffers, two sources, no polling. About 32.3 MiB decoded at 44.1 kHz stereo. Cache/context disposed and references released on map leave/destruction.",
    "scope": "Shared frontend in Adventure, Rift and Colosseum. PvP/wild/other trainer themes and real account/server/SQL data unchanged."
